          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Fractions in Disguise"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.089,
            0.848,
            0.148
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Bank of Wahapur offers an interest of 5% p.a. Compare how much one gets if one deposits ₹20,000 for a period of 4 years with compounding and without compounding annually."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.156,
            0.846,
            0.194
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. Do you observe anything interesting in the solutions of the two questions above? Share and discuss."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.198,
            0.801,
            0.22
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us try to generalise the pattern observed in each of the options."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.227,
            0.845,
            0.268
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example 9:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " What is the amount we get back if we invest ₹6000 at an interest rate of 10% p.a. for ‘t’ years?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.276,
            0.342,
            0.297
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "No Compounding"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.3,
            0.848,
            0.357
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Here, the interest gained every term is paid back. Therefore, the principal amount for every term shall remain the same, and as a result, the interest gained every term also shall be the same."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.37,
            0.485,
            0.405
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The interest gained in 1 term is 6000 × 0.1 The interest gained in 3 terms is"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.239,
            0.404,
            0.364,
            0.421
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_22_equation_8.jpg",
          "content": "6 0 0 0 \\times 0 . 1 \\times 3"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.421,
            0.484,
            0.454
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The total amount at the end of an FD of 3 years is"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.199,
            0.454,
            0.401,
            0.473
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_22_equation_10.jpg",
          "content": "6 0 0 0 \\div ( 6 0 0 0 \\times 0 . 1 \\times 3 ) ."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
