          "bbox": [
            0.494,
            0.37,
            0.883,
            0.422
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The interest gained in 1 term is p × r (p is the principal, r is the rate of interest in percentage)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.544,
            0.421,
            0.832,
            0.44
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The interest gained in t terms is"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
