          "bbox": [
            0.587,
            0.488,
            0.787,
            0.524
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_22_equation_15.jpg",
          "content": "p + (p \\times r \\times t) = p + rrt"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
